  "reason": "RNA-only models outperform image-only, and scvi_n200 with multiprofile avgpool is currently best (0.650 accuracy, 0.628 F1). It is unclear whether this gain is due to the scvi representation or to multiprofile avgpool. config_004 tests the same scvi_n200 encoder with singleprofile, isolating the profile-setting effect without introducing image or fusion confounds. This simple experiment will establish whether multiprofile aggregation is necessary for the best RNA encoder and provide a stronger baseline before considering multimodal extensions."
